    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cozy chaos of <i>Apartment Filled With Cats</i>, a heartwarming hidden object game featuring hand-drawn illustration bursting with charm and personality. Every nook and cranny of this whimsical apartment is a treasure trove of clever hiding spots for cats of all shapes and sizes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413650/extras/4e061fc16db7b113f3d017c70c4386cf.poster.avif?t=1739883728\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413650/extras/4e061fc16db7b113f3d017c70c4386cf.webm?t=1739883728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413650/extras/4e061fc16db7b113f3d017c70c4386cf.mp4?t=1739883728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Perfect for cat lovers, puzzle enthusiasts, and anyone seeking a soothing escape, <i>Apartment Filled With Cats</i> invites you to slow down, explore, and enjoy the delightful details. With relaxing gameplay, playful surprises, and a soundtrack that feels as playful as a cat's purr, this game is the ultimate hidden object adventure. Grab a cup of tea, settle in, and uncover every last whiskered companion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cozy chaos of <i>Apartment Filled With Cats</i>, a heartwarming hidden object game featuring hand-drawn illustration bursting with charm and personality. Every nook and cranny of this whimsical apartment is a treasure trove of clever hiding spots for cats of all shapes and sizes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413650/extras/4e061fc16db7b113f3d017c70c4386cf.poster.avif?t=1739883728\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413650/extras/4e061fc16db7b113f3d017c70c4386cf.webm?t=1739883728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413650/extras/4e061fc16db7b113f3d017c70c4386cf.mp4?t=1739883728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Perfect for cat lovers, puzzle enthusiasts, and anyone seeking a soothing escape, <i>Apartment Filled With Cats</i> invites you to slow down, explore, and enjoy the delightful details. With relaxing gameplay, playful surprises, and a soundtrack that feels as playful as a cat's purr, this game is the ultimate hidden object adventure. Grab a cup of tea, settle in, and uncover every last whiskered companion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings</p></li></ul>",
